<P>And don't forget about the other features such as submitting your guild for a guild slot in the forums on your server, chatting in dedicated server chat rooms (each server gets its own!), and much more.  If you have any questions you may contact us at <a href="mailto:admin@eq2servers.com">admin@eq2servers.com</a>, or read our <a href="http://www.eq2servers.com/modules.php?name=FAQ">Network FAQ</a>.
