                      <td><font class="news"><a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;new_topic=5"><img src="images/topics/sitenews.gif" alt="Site News" title="Site News" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>After a two week outage due to our server going down, we are finally back.  Nothing has changed from what you remember and everything is freely available for your use, and this time on a more secure server and space than ever before.  What occured the past couple of weeks for EQII Servers and EQII.com was an extremely unusual and highly rare circumstance.  It was unfortunate that it had to happen to us.

